  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade mission to Moldova for Dutch companies based in Romania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The trade mission will contribute to the strengthening of bilateral trade relations between the Netherlands and the Republic of Moldova as part of a broader bilateral agenda on the one hand. On the other hand, the project will contribute to private sector development in the Republic of Moldova. We aim to support economic development by helping to improve the business climate. The project will lead to strengthened economic ties, increase knowledge about market opportunities for Dutch companies and give an impulse to Dutch companies&apos; interest in Moldova. The contacts between Dutch and Moldovan companies and the transfer of knowledge and ideas will strengthen the private sector in Moldova.</narrative>
  </description>
